# dvide (Cyclewise)

Salary-cycle personal finance tracker. Money flows through one waterfall: Income − Set aside = Spendable − Spent = Balance (safe-to-spend per day).

Package: com.knownassurajit.dvide_finance.app. Source dirs remain com/dvide/cyclewise/.
Keep the waterfall engine consistent across Editorial, Gauge, and Cards dashboards.
Do not rename the public product (Cyclewise) when changing code. Load the material-design skill for M3 Expressive UI.

## Stack

Kotlin 2.1 · Compose · Material 3 Expressive · MVVM/UDF · Hilt · Room · DataStore · minSdk 26 / targetSdk 35.

## Verify

`./gradlew assembleDebug | test | lintDebug`

## ECC workflow

1. Plan non-trivial work with the planner agent / plan skill.
2. Implement with tests first (`tdd-workflow`).
3. Review with `code-reviewer` and `security-reviewer` before merge-level changes.
4. Keep secrets out of prompts and commits. Prefer small, reviewable diffs.

